# Real environment files and compose's own .env hold live secrets: never commit
# them. Only the templates in env.example/ are tracked. Copy them to env/ and
# fill them in locally (see Docker/README.md).
#
# This replaces the old "env/ is tracked on purpose" rule. That rule existed for
# a private mirror repo, which is no longer kept up to date.
env/
.env
mongodb
